<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 10: </span>Comparison of detectors on our proposed <span id="S7.T10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">OmniGen</span> test set based on real and fake class accuracy. Detectors marked with * were evaluated using their official pretrained weights. Results are in the format: 
<table id="S7.T10.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S7.T10.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
